    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"The evaluation reveals whether increased model complexity provides\\n\",\n",
    "    \"meaningful predictive improvement over linear regression.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"If ensemble models do not significantly outperform linear models,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"this suggests that short-term temperature dynamics are largely linear\\n\",\n",
    "    \"within the engineered feature space.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"If performance improves, this indicates nonlinear interactions\\n\",\n",
    "    \"between lag and rolling predictors.\\n\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"id\": \"b040f564ab909396\"\n",
    "  }\n",
